/v1/","context":{"app_id":4612760,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1847286114027871","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes v0.5.1","summary":"Hey Rammers, just some leftover bug squashing, along with some item polish! Hope you are having fun! Don't forget to leave a review!ChangedRemoved the startup playtest notice.Bear Traps have a clearer wind-up and snap, throwing off metal sparks and briefly squeezing your goat as the jaws clamp shut.Boomerangs spin smoothly in time with their flight sound, with trails following their tips. They burst into wooden fragments with an impact sound when they break.FixedRing world text timer is now not ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:38:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027871","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:42:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1846651706691529","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.5 - NEXT FEST & Join-In-Progress Matches","summary":"Hey Rammers! Got a lovely update to address some of the more annoying issues when playing online (lobbies, latency, fairness and items!), along with some nice QoL!We will also be participating in and getting ready for the upcoming OCTOBER NEXT FEST (today)!! Please tell your friends, peers and family... Report bugs or feedback with F9 or Right Stick Click! We really appreciate it all ːsteamhappyːHighlightsDrop into ongoing matches. Hold Charge to join, or just stay spectating. Take an empty slot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691529","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1846651706691252","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"announcement","title":"How To GET RAMMED (together)","summary":"Hey Rammer! What to GET RAMMED, and not sure how? Come, I'll guide you... Don't forget to leave a review!PlayLocal or Online, with support for local within online matches with up to 8 players. Host a game via Play. Connect to a game via Join...Join has a variety of ways to get in touch with another competitor. You can even join matches in progress! Do this via:Lobby Code (shown to hosts within the Advanced Game Settings menu in Lobby)Steam Invite/OverlayLobby Browser - See all friends-only and p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:55:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691252","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1846018067934053","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"announcement","title":"GET RAMMED Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hey Rammers! We have got it out the door. We released something juicy, polished, and full of chaotic goat mayhem! A GET RAMMED Demo...New TrailerCheck out the release trailer!DEMO Expectations!Full Online/Local Multiplayer SupportPlay with up to 8 players in a match of GET RAMMED! You may mix and match local and online play in this game, meaning two or more friends on the same couch can still play online together.We really want all of you to get to play with each other as fast as possible, with ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:59:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1843481262692023","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"announcement","title":"GET RAMMED's first TRAILER is here!","summary":"Our first TRAILER is here! Really proud of all the work we put into it, we all had so much fun creating it. See you sooner than you think 👀... Wishlist now, if you haven't already tell your friends, family and enemies! Thank you and see ya!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T12:13:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4612760-1836506165575710","game_id":"steam-4612760","kind":"announcement","title":"GET RAMMED Playtest is now LIVE!","summary":"Welcome Rammers!You can join the playtest by requesting access on the GET RAMMED Store Page! We are accepting players based on capacity and interest.First of all, a massive thank you from everyone here at Hyrax Studios for headbutting your way into our playtest!We want GET RAMMED to be the ultimate party game to play with friends and family, and your feedback, bug reporting and testing are crucial to helping us nail that experience. Please be as honest as possible, tell us what made you laugh, w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T10:51:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165575710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4612760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4612760":"2026-10-26T03:15:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4612